  "releaseNotes": "- fix: bump FSharp.Compiler.Service 43.8 → 43.10 (with FSharp.Core 10.0.101) so the analyzer reads the F# signature data emitted by net9/net10 compilers. A referenced package built by a newer fsc than the tool (e.g. a fresh Aardvark.Dom/SceneGraph CI build) previously loaded with ZERO types — every view failed with a misleading \"namespace X is not defined\". The newer FCS reads old and new signatures, so the tool now works across net8/net10 toolchains.",
